  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitanapa Nebukadnesa pooki ng'ae meteserema enkitanyaanyukoto e sahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitobir olaiguanani Nebukadnesa enkitanyaanyukoto e sahabu, naa ore enkadoro enye naa ntemat e nkaina ntomoni ile naa ntemat e nkaina ile neitasheiyie ninye enkong'ata e Dura, to lkerenket e Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Nebukadnesa airriwaa ilkiliku meiturrurruni ilkituaak o laitasheikinok sunash ogelema o lbalusuni o ilaiguanak o ilashumak loo mpisai o ilkituaak loo nkitanapat o lkituaak pooki loo loshon pee epuonu enkitisinyata ina kitanyaanyukoto natesheta olaiguanani Nebukadnesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrurro lelo kituaak, o laitasheikinok sunash ogelema, o lbalusuni, o lautarok o lashumak loo mpisai, o ilkituaak loo nkitanapat, o iladung'ok loo nkiguanat o lelo kituaak loo lkerenket, tenkaraki enkitisinyata e ina kitanyaanyukoto natesheta olaiguanani Nebukadnesa; neitashe ninche te dukuya ina kitanyaanyukoto natesheta Nebukadnesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo kilikuai, neibalunye to ltoilo sapuk ajo, “Eitanapaki intae, loo rere, nakuapi, o lng'ejepa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchere ore ti nining'ining'i oltoilo le mowuo, o endule, o lwulul loo usin, o enkinanta nanyaanyukie olwulul, o enkawuo oo sinkolioitin, o lbene olkuti te ndule, o pooki pukunoto o sinkolio, nirrugogo aabaiki enkop, aaserem ina kitanyaanyukoto e sahabu naitasheyie olaiguanani Nebukadnesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore pooki ng'ae lemebatata aserem nepuoi nabo kata aanang'aki atua olkokuet le nkima oyupuyup.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore ake pee ening iloreren ilo toilo le mowuo o lwulul loo usin, o enkinanta nanyaanyukie olwulul, o enkawuo oo sinkolioitin, o lbene okuti te ndule, o pooki pukunoto o sinkolio, ore iltung'ana pooki, o loreren o lng'ejepa nebatata pooki te dukuya ina kitanyaanyukoto e sahabu naitasheyie olaiguanani Nebukadnesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitang'oroki ilchoreta pokira okuni le Daniel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore apa teina kata nepuonu kulikae Kaldayo dukuya neitang'or lelo Yahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche olaiguanani Nebukadnesa, “Laaiguanani, tobiko ntarasi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iyie, laaiguanani, intobira enkitanapata, nchere ore pooki tung'ani oning oltoilo le mowuo, o endule, o lwulul loo usin, o enkinanta nanyaanyukie olwulul, o enkawuo oo sinkolioitin, o lbene okuti te ndule, o pooki pukunoto o sinkolio naa kebatata aserem ina kitanyaanyukoto e sahabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore oloba anaa olemebatata aserem nenang'akini atua olkokuet le nkima oyupuyup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii kulikae Yahudi litegelua iyie meitasheiki mbaa olkerenket le Babilon: Shadrak, o Meshek o Abednego. Eji ore kulo tung'ana, laaiguanani, mikishilaa ninche iyie; meisiaai ninche nkaitin inono aashu eserem ina kitanyaanyukoto e sahabu nintasheyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitanapisho Nebukadnesa te ngoro napi meyauni Shadrak o Meshak o Abednego. Neyauni kulo tung'ana dukuya olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Nebukadnesa ninche, “Kesipa doi, Shadrak o Meshak o Abednego, nchere misiaayiayia intae nkaitin aainei aashu iserememe ina kitanyaanyukoto e sahabu naitasheyie nanu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata ti niterretenate, ti nining'ining'i oltoilo le mowuo o le ndule o lwulul loo usin o enkinanta nanyaanyukie olwulul, o enkawuo oo sinkolioitin o lbene okuti te ndule, o pooki pukunoto o sinkolio, naa nibatatata aaserem ina kitanyaanyukoto e sahabu naitobira nanu, naa aisidai ina. Kake tinimiserememe intae, nenang'akini intae nabo kata atua olkokuet oyupuyup; naa kaa ai ina naidim atokordu intae aitayu too nkaik aainei?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Shadrak o Meshak o Abednego olaiguanani nejoki, “Oo Nebukadnesa, mikiaata iyiook tipat pee kiwaliki iyie tena bae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa tenaa neijia, ore Enkai ang naa ninye kisiaai naa keidim atokordu iyiook aitayu ti atua ilo kokuet oyupuyup; naa kekordu ninye iyiook aitung'uaa enkaina ino, laaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te neitu, tayiolo iyie, laaiguanani nchere, mikisiaai iyiook nkaitin inono aashu kiserem ina kitanyaanyukoto e sahabu nintasheyie iyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etudung'okoki ilchoreta okuni le Daniel enkikiguana e nkeeya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiput Nebukadnesa engoro napi, ore enkomom enye neibelekenya arruoyo ti alo Shadrak o Meshak o Abednego. Neitanapisho ninye meinoki ilo kokuet le nkima aaitulusoo katitin naapishana tena duoo kijukujuk e kiyupuyup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitanap kulikae tung'ana magil le njore enye meteena Shadrak o Meshek o Abednego, nenang'aki ninche atua ilo kokuet oyupuyup le nkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neeni kulo tung'ana eishopito nkilani enye e atua o nioriong, o nkopiyiani enye o kulikae kilani lenye, nenang'akini ninche atua olkokuet le nkima oyupuyup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki narrish apa ina kitanapata o laiguanani neirowua oleng ilo kokuet le nkima, etang'amayie olng'ejep le nkima anya lelo tung'ana ootudumutua Shadrak o Meshek o Abednego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kulo tung'ana okuni, Shadrak o Meshak o Abednego, nesulakini eena atua ilo kokuet le nkima oyupuyup.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'asia olaiguanani Nebukadnesa nedumunye nabo kata. Nejoki ninye ilarikok lenyena, “Keitu iyiook kinang'aki iltung'ana okuni eena atua enkima?” Newaliki ninche olaiguanani ejo, “Esipa, Laaiguanani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki ninye ajo, “Kake adolita nanu iltung'ana oong'uan lemeena oopuoito te mpolos e nkima, neitu eiseyieki; ore eliooto e ilo li ong'uan nenyaanyukie enkerai oo nkaitin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etalakuaki lelo tung'ana okuni neilepieki aaisho enkitoo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Nebukadnesa anyiku enkutuk e ilo kokuet le nkima nayupuyup nejo, “Shadrak o Meshak o Abednego, isinkan le Nkai natii shumata aisul, wootu elepu, naa wootu ene!” Neipang'u Shadrak o Meshek o Abednego ti atua enkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo kituaak, o laitasheikinok sunaishi oogelema o lbalusuni o laikook lo laiguanani neiturrurro te nebo nedol aajo eitu etum enkima ai golon too seseni le lelo tung'ana; ore ilpapit loo lukuny enye eitu ninye eisui, ore nkilani enye neitu eikoni ae, nemetii olng'usil le nkima ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Nebukadnesa, “Meisisi Enkai e Shadrak o Meshek o Abednego, nairriwua ninye olmalaika lenye netokordua isinkan lenyena, lelo ooisiliga ninye, neitu eitaa toki enkitanapata o laiguanani, neitayu iseseni lenye alang te neisiaai neserem ae neme ina Ai enye maate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa kaitayu enkitanapata: Ore pooki orere, o pooki kop, o pooki ng'ejep oiro inaapaashare Enkai e Shadrak o Meshek o Abednego nedung'i aaitaa ndung'udung'ot, ore nkajijik enye neidaikieki; amu meetae ae Ai naidim atokordu tena pukunoto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neilepie olaiguanani aisho enkitoo Shadrak o Meshek o Abednego to lkerenket le Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
